# 🍔 매출 분석 키오스크 (2023 SW Kiosk)

<p align="center">
  <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/version-1.0.0-blue.svg" alt="Version">
  <img src="https://img.shields.io/github/stars/kimdoyoung1110/2023-sw-kiosk?style=flat-square" alt="Stars">
